00:03:47,410 --> 00:03:49,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for you, Kiba-kun and Akamaru.</font>

65
00:03:52,620 --> 00:03:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rather than worrying about others,</font>

