00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:57,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba-kun...</font>

68
00:03:58,590 --> 00:03:59,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are only 6 people left...</font>

