152
00:04:38,540 --> 00:04:40,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Hyuga Hinata</font></font></b></font>

153
00:04:38,540 --> 00:04:40,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Hyuga Neji</font></font></b></font>

154
00:04:44,510 --> 00:04:45,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

155
00:04:46,140 --> 00:04:49,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is going to be an interesting match...</font>

156
00:05:06,450 --> 00:05:09,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never thought that I would
have a fight with you...</font>

157
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata-sama.</font>

158
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:12,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji nii-san...</font>

159
00:05:13,250 --> 00:05:14,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san?</font>

160
00:05:14,580 --> 00:05:15,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

161
00:05:15,580 --> 00:05:17,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those two are siblings?</font>

162
00:05:23,380 --> 00:05:24,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're descended from</font>

163
00:05:24,470 --> 00:05:27,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one of the most honorable
old families in the Hidden Leaf...</font>

164
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hyuga Clan.</font>

165
00:05:30,010 --> 00:05:32,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, they're not siblings.</font>

166
00:05:32,350 --> 00:05:34,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, how are they related?</font>

167
00:05:38,190 --> 00:05:41,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, the relation of a head family
and branch family...</font>

168
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:43,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That may be an appropriate
way to say it.</font>

169
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Head family and branch family?</font>

170
00:05:46,490 --> 00:05:47,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

171
00:05:47,910 --> 00:05:50,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata-san is from the head family.</font>

172
00:05:50,620 --> 00:05:52,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, a person from
the main household</font>

173
00:05:52,830 --> 00:05:55,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and Neji is from a branch family
that is descended from that family.</font>

174
00:05:56,370 --> 00:05:59,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,
it's a fight between relatives.</font>

175
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:02,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It must be uneasy for both of them...</font>

176
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:03,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

177
00:06:03,750 --> 00:06:04,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

178
00:06:04,670 --> 00:06:06,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What is it?</font>

179
00:06:06,970 --> 00:06:08,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've heard that from long ago,</font>

180
00:06:08,630 --> 00:06:10,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there've been various incidents between
the head family and branch family,</font>

181
00:06:10,850 --> 00:06:13,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and now their relationship
isn't on very good terms.</font>

182
00:06:14,350 --> 00:06:15,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmmm.</font>

183
00:06:15,850 --> 00:06:16,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

184
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:18,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know the details either.</font>

185
00:06:18,940 --> 00:06:19,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only...</font>

186
00:06:20,310 --> 00:06:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The so-called distinguished Ninja clans
like Uchiha and Hyuga</font>

187
00:06:24,940 --> 00:06:27,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have special techniques and
abilities that run in the family.</font>

188
00:06:28,610 --> 00:06:31,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that the Hyuga household
laid down rules</font>

189
00:06:31,530 --> 00:06:33,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for communicating those techniques...</font>

190
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:37,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that there are many rules
that favor the head family...</font>

191
00:06:37,580 --> 00:06:38,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— Huh?</font>

192
00:06:39,210 --> 00:06:40,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there have been
various incidents</font>

193
00:06:40,710 --> 00:06:43,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">between the head family and
branch family due to those rules.</font>

194
00:06:46,010 --> 00:06:48,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is a confrontation billed
as a clash of fate...</font>

195
00:06:56,810 --> 00:06:58,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's gonna begin.</font>

196
00:06:59,770 --> 00:07:02,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Start the battle please!</font>

197
00:07:04,900 --> 00:07:07,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just one thing before we square off
against each other in the fight...</font>

198
00:07:07,900 --> 00:07:09,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should advise you, Hinata-sama.</font>

199
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Withdraw!</font>

200
00:07:12,820 --> 00:07:14,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not suited to being a Shinobi.</font>

201
00:07:18,620 --> 00:07:20,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're too nice.</font>

202
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:23,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You wish for harmony and
avoid conflict,</font>

203
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:26,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're open to going with
the thinking of others.</font>

204
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:31,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, you have no confidence
in yourself.</font>

205
00:07:32,090 --> 00:07:34,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're always feeling inferior...</font>

206
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:37,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You thought it's a good idea
to stay Genin.</font>

207
00:07:38,180 --> 00:07:41,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, you can't register for
the Chunin test without three members...</font>

208
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:45,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you couldn't turn down when Kiba
and the other proposed it and,</font>

209
00:07:45,770 --> 00:07:48,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the truth is, you entered
the exam reluctantly.</font>

210
00:07:49,900 --> 00:07:50,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that wrong?!</font>

211
00:07:50,950 --> 00:07:52,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-That's wrong...</font>

212
00:07:52,740 --> 00:07:53,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not true...</font>

213
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

214
00:07:55,740 --> 00:07:56,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I only...</font>

215
00:07:58,200 --> 00:07:59,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to change that about myself...</font>

216
00:07:59,950 --> 00:08:00,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I proposed it myself...</font>

217
00:08:08,170 --> 00:08:08,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

218
00:08:19,310 --> 00:08:21,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stand up, Hanabi!</font>

219
00:08:26,150 --> 00:08:28,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From now on, I'll keep Hinata
under my wing...</font>

220
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:31,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But is that really okay?</font>

221
00:08:34,740 --> 00:08:37,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata should be the heir to
the Hyuga clan...</font>

222
00:08:37,950 --> 00:08:41,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, there is always death involved
with the job of Genin.</font>

223
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:44,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do what you want.</font>

224
00:08:46,380 --> 00:08:50,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's a failure who's inferior even to her
younger sister Hanabi, five years her junior.</font>

225
00:08:50,590 --> 00:08:52,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't need her here
in the Hyuga clan...</font>

226
00:09:00,470 --> 00:09:02,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that all you have to say?</font>

227
00:09:03,060 --> 00:09:04,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so, leave!</font>

228
00:09:04,940 --> 00:09:05,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're in the way!</font>

229
00:09:06,850 --> 00:09:07,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

230
00:09:19,530 --> 00:09:22,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata is trying to change
herself in her own way.</font>

231
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:34,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata-sama...</font>

232
00:09:35,470 --> 00:09:37,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are a spoiled one of
the head family.</font>

233
00:09:39,430 --> 00:09:41,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People can never change!</font>

234
00:09:43,890 --> 00:09:45,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A failure will always be a failure...</font>

235
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:49,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That personality and strength
won't change.</font>

236
00:09:54,490 --> 00:09:55,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy...</font>

237
00:10:01,620 --> 00:10:04,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since people don't change,
differences exist among them...</font>

238
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:08,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and expressions like "elite"
and "failure" are born.</font>

239
00:10:09,420 --> 00:10:11,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone judges and are judged</font>

240
00:10:11,130 --> 00:10:13,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">based on the value of their face and
brain, ability and body type,</font>

241
00:10:13,340 --> 00:10:16,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">good and bad points of
their personalities.</font>

242
00:10:17,630 --> 00:10:20,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People have to suffer and live</font>

243
00:10:20,090 --> 00:10:24,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">within the means of the
elements they cannot change.</font>

244
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:27,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like the fact that I'm from a
branch family</font>

245
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you're from the head family,</font>

246
00:10:29,940 --> 00:10:31,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">these things can't change.</font>

247
00:10:34,110 --> 00:10:37,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've seen everything with
this Byakugan.</font>

248
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:39,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I understand!</font>

249
00:10:40,030 --> 00:10:41,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're just talking tough.</font>

250
00:10:42,660 --> 00:10:46,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're really thinking that you'd
like to run away from this place...</font>

251
00:10:47,370 --> 00:10:48,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-That's wrong...</font>

252
00:10:48,910 --> 00:10:50,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I really...</font>

253
00:10:50,670 --> 00:10:51,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan?</font>

254
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's said that if you trace
the Uchiha Clan's history,</font>

255
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:57,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the clan's ability has its source
in Hyuga clan.</font>

256
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:03,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Byakugan is one of the
Hyuga clan's Kekkei Genkai,</font>

257
00:11:04,180 --> 00:11:06,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a Visual Jutsu similar
to Sharingan...</font>

258
00:11:06,810 --> 00:11:09,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, with the ability of insight alone...</font>

259
00:11:09,980 --> 00:11:12,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it gets the better of Sharingan.</font>

260
00:11:23,950 --> 00:11:24,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

261
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:30,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Hyuga Hinata</font></font></b></font>

262
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:30,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Hyuga Neji</font></font></b></font>

263
00:12:19,050 --> 00:12:20,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My eyes can't be deceived.</font>

264
00:12:22,380 --> 00:12:23,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just now from my pressure,</font>

265
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:28,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your line of sight was pushed
to the upper left.</font>

266
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:32,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the sign that you're recalling
your past experience...</font>

267
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:35,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your bitter past.</font>

268
00:12:36,150 --> 00:12:39,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And soon after that, your line of sight
moved to the bottom right...</font>

269
00:12:40,690 --> 00:12:45,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the sign that you're imagining
physical and mental suffering.</font>

270
00:12:46,620 --> 00:12:47,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means...</font>

271
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:50,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're picturing your old self,</font>

272
00:12:50,450 --> 00:12:52,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and from all of your experiences
up until now,</font>

273
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:54,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're imagining the result
of this battle...</font>

274
00:12:55,830 --> 00:12:58,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The image of you losing!</font>

275
00:13:07,390 --> 00:13:10,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even the act of propping your arms
in front of your body...</font>

276
00:13:11,770 --> 00:13:13,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a gesture that means</font>

277
00:13:13,810 --> 00:13:16,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you want to build a wall
between us and keep distant.</font>

278
00:13:18,310 --> 00:13:19,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that reflects your mind...</font>

279
00:13:19,820 --> 00:13:22,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that you don't want any more
of your deepest feelings to be raided...</font>

280
00:13:24,030 --> 00:13:26,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because everything I've said
is right on the mark, right?</font>

281
00:13:28,700 --> 00:13:29,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Furthermore...</font>

282
00:13:34,910 --> 00:13:36,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Laying a finger on your lips,</font>

283
00:13:36,580 --> 00:13:39,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that too, is a self-familiarizing act
which represents a sense of panic.</font>

284
00:13:41,380 --> 00:13:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It represents a defense instinct...</font>

285
00:13:43,670 --> 00:13:46,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you want to alleviate the tension
and unease.</font>

286
00:13:47,630 --> 00:13:48,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words...</font>

287
00:13:49,390 --> 00:13:52,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">deep in your heart,
you know it's true, don't you?</font>

288
00:13:54,270 --> 00:13:57,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Changing yourself,
is something you absolutely can't...!</font>

289
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:58,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure, she can!</font>

290
00:14:07,110 --> 00:14:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have the privilege of
deciding what a person is like, stupid!</font>

291
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:12,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give it to him, Hinata!</font>

292
00:14:16,580 --> 00:14:17,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

293
00:14:26,340 --> 00:14:27,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

294
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't just take it!
Argue back!</font>

295
00:14:30,140 --> 00:14:32,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm getting irritated watching this!</font>

296
00:14:48,530 --> 00:14:49,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

297
00:14:51,070 --> 00:14:52,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What an annoying guy!</font>

298
00:14:59,710 --> 00:15:00,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

299
00:15:03,540 --> 00:15:04,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you!</font>

300
00:15:09,470 --> 00:15:10,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The expression of her eyes
has changed...</font>

301
00:15:12,390 --> 00:15:13,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're not going to withdraw?</font>

302
00:15:14,010 --> 00:15:15,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I‘m not taking responsibility
for what happens!</font>

303
00:15:16,810 --> 00:15:17,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

304
00:15:20,190 --> 00:15:21,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't run away!</font>

305
00:15:22,350 --> 00:15:23,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't...</font>

306
00:15:23,810 --> 00:15:26,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't change my words...</font>

307
00:15:26,730 --> 00:15:28,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my Ninja Way!</font>

308
00:15:29,780 --> 00:15:30,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...want to run anymore!</font>

309
00:15:32,570 --> 00:15:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

310
00:15:44,460 --> 00:15:45,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji nii-san!</font>

311
00:15:46,630 --> 00:15:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I challenge you!</font>

312
00:15:48,590 --> 00:15:49,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-That is...</font>

313
00:16:00,020 --> 00:16:01,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine...</font>

314
00:16:06,190 --> 00:16:08,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, the same Hyuga style...</font>

315
00:16:09,110 --> 00:16:11,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Her pose is very similar
to Neji's.</font>

316
00:16:11,530 --> 00:16:12,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hyuga style?</font>

317
00:16:13,610 --> 00:16:16,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The strongest Taijutsu style
in the Village Hidden in the Leaf...</font>

318
00:16:16,280 --> 00:16:16,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

319
00:16:17,700 --> 00:16:19,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said it before...</font>

320
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:22,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The man who is most likely</font>

321
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:25,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the strongest Genin of Hidden
Leaf Village is on my team...</font>

322
00:16:26,130 --> 00:16:26,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

323
00:16:27,500 --> 00:16:29,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy, Hyuga Neji.</font>

324
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:17,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here!</font>

325
00:17:26,690 --> 00:17:27,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did it go in?!</font>

326
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:29,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... it was shallow!</font>

327
00:17:29,610 --> 00:17:32,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. Even a graze works.</font>

328
00:17:33,490 --> 00:17:34,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the reason that the Hyuga clan</font>

329
00:17:35,070 --> 00:17:37,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is called the Hidden Leaf's
distinguished family.</font>

330
00:17:37,740 --> 00:17:39,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What do you mean?</font>

331
00:17:39,990 --> 00:17:44,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hyuga has a particular
Taijutsu passed down through generations.</font>

332
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:51,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like the kind of Taijutsu that
Lee and I are good at...</font>

333
00:17:51,590 --> 00:17:55,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our way of fighting, Furious Fist,</font>

334
00:17:55,050 --> 00:17:58,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is mainly to inflict external damage
on our enemy,</font>

335
00:17:58,890 --> 00:18:00,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">like broken bones and surface wounds.</font>

336
00:18:01,810 --> 00:18:04,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In contrast, the Hyuga's Taijutsu
inflict damage</font>

337
00:18:04,390 --> 00:18:06,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on the Chakra Network through
which Chakra flow through the body,</font>

338
00:18:06,770 --> 00:18:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and damaging the insides,
namely, it destroys internal organs.</font>

339
00:18:11,110 --> 00:18:13,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They possess the Gentle Fist.</font>

340
00:18:14,280 --> 00:18:15,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not spectacular to watch...</font>

341
00:18:16,490 --> 00:18:18,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but later it slowly takes effect.</font>

342
00:18:19,410 --> 00:18:22,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, you can't train the internal organs...</font>

343
00:18:23,410 --> 00:18:24,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you were really robust,</font>

344
00:18:25,040 --> 00:18:27,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one hit from it would be
a deadly blow...</font>

345
00:18:39,220 --> 00:18:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even I can...</font>

346
00:18:42,140 --> 00:18:43,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata's on the offensive...</font>

347
00:18:44,510 --> 00:18:45,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

348
00:18:47,730 --> 00:18:49,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Way to go, Hinata!</font>

349
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:52,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To attack the Chakra Network...</font>

350
00:18:53,320 --> 00:18:55,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are they, those people...?</font>

351
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:57,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey!</font>

352
00:18:58,820 --> 00:19:01,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra Network, what's that?!</font>

353
00:19:01,570 --> 00:19:02,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we go again...</font>

354
00:19:02,780 --> 00:19:04,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a question from a stupid guy.</font>

355
00:19:04,990 --> 00:19:06,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll explain.</font>

356
00:19:07,250 --> 00:19:08,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're like blood canals.</font>

357
00:19:08,580 --> 00:19:10,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the same way that blood flows
through vessels throughout the body,</font>

358
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:16,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're bundles of canals that take
Chakras into every corner of your body...</font>

359
00:19:17,550 --> 00:19:18,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

360
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:21,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like a path for Chakras, huh?</font>

361
00:19:21,340 --> 00:19:22,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

362
00:19:22,590 --> 00:19:24,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Furthermore, the Chakra Network
is closely connected</font>

363
00:19:24,180 --> 00:19:28,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the internal organs which
enfold Chakra within the body.</font>

364
00:19:28,930 --> 00:19:31,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why if
the Chakra Network is attacked</font>

365
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:33,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the internal organs also suffer damage.</font>

366
00:19:34,270 --> 00:19:36,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, you know a lot, don't 'ya?</font>

367
00:19:36,980 --> 00:19:39,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you!
That's no way to talk to your senior!</font>

368
00:19:50,660 --> 00:19:51,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no wonder...</font>

369
00:19:52,620 --> 00:19:54,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee's greatest long-standing enemy.</font>

370
00:19:55,130 --> 00:19:56,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

371
00:19:56,210 --> 00:19:57,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">him.</font>

372
00:19:59,090 --> 00:20:00,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei...</font>

373
00:20:00,220 --> 00:20:02,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, how can they do that?</font>

374
00:20:02,930 --> 00:20:06,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, the Chakra Network
isn't visible to the eyes.</font>

375
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:10,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How do they attack the Chakra
line inside the body?</font>

376
00:20:10,890 --> 00:20:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No.</font>

377
00:20:12,310 --> 00:20:13,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The eyes of those two...</font>

378
00:20:14,230 --> 00:20:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They can see it with
their Byakugan.</font>

379
00:20:22,780 --> 00:20:26,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And a Gentle Fist attack is a little
different from a regular attack.</font>

380
00:20:28,490 --> 00:20:30,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They release their own Chakra</font>

381
00:20:30,410 --> 00:20:34,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from a Chakra opening in their hand
and screw it into their opponent's body.</font>

382
00:20:35,290 --> 00:20:38,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It directly inflicts damage on
your enemy's Chakra Network.</font>

383
00:20:41,470 --> 00:20:42,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

384
00:20:45,340 --> 00:20:46,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Has she done it?</font>

385
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:11,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

386
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:11,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font>

387
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">sora wa hate shinaku aoku sunde ite</font></b></font></font></font>

388
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the clear, blue sky goes on and on</font></b></font></font></font>

389
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:29,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">umi wa kagiri naku koudai de ite</font></b></font></font>

390
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:29,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the ocean spans limitlessly</font></b></font></font></font>

391
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kimi wa itsumade mo egao de ite</font></b></font></font>

392
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">please keep that smile on your face forever</font></b></font></font></font>

393
00:21:38,390 --> 00:21:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">janai to nai chau kara</font></b></font></font>

394
00:21:38,390 --> 00:21:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">or else I'll cry</font></b></font></font></font>

395
00:21:44,300 --> 00:21:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mawari o mimawasa naku temo</font></b></font></font>

396
00:21:44,300 --> 00:21:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">You won't have to search around you</font></b></font></font></font>

397
00:21:48,470 --> 00:21:52,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mou iin da yo</font></b></font></font>

398
00:21:48,470 --> 00:21:52,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">it's all ok now</font></b></font></font></font>

399
00:21:52,310 --> 00:22:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kono to no naka ni wa minna ga iru kara</font></b></font></font>

400
00:21:52,310 --> 00:22:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">everyone is inside this hand</font></b></font></font></font>

401
00:22:01,250 --> 00:22:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">naki taku natte nige taku natte</font></b></font></font>

402
00:22:01,250 --> 00:22:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">when you want to cry, and you want to run away</font></b></font></font>

403
00:22:06,520 --> 00:22:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">shiawase o wasure te te shimatta ra</font></b></font></font>

404
00:22:06,520 --> 00:22:10,990
