415
00:22:38,620 --> 00:22:39,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Amazing!</font>

416
00:22:39,620 --> 00:22:40,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">That Hinata!</font>

417
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:43,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">She's always melancholy
