418
00:22:43,170 --> 00:22:45,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I thought she is kinda weird, yet...</font>

419
00:22:45,380 --> 00:22:47,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Even when she gets blow after blow,
she gets back up and goes.</font>

420
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:49,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">There's something about
her way of fighting.</font>

421
00:22:49,970 --> 00:22:51,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Just a feeling,
but she resembles you, I think.</font>

422
00:22:51,340 --> 00:22:53,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Resembles me?
Hinata resembles me?</font>

423
00:22:53,930 --> 00:22:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Now that I think about it, that girl,
she was always watching you.</font>

424
00:22:56,680 --> 00:22:57,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Huh?</font>

425
